Functional requirements

Accept a story idea (10–600 characters) plus genre, style and panel count (2–8)
Generate a title and a per-panel caption and dialogue
Generate one image per panel in the chosen style
Show loading placeholders while generating and a clear error message on failure
Print the comic and export it as JSON

Non-functional requirements

Responsive layout (desktop and mobile)
Accessible: labelled form fields, aria-live updates, focus outlines, reduced-motion support, alt text on images
Acceptable wait time (the UI warns it can take up to a minute)
API key kept on the server, never in the browser

Technical requirements

Area	Choice
Frontend	HTML, CSS, vanilla JavaScript
Backend	Python, FastAPI
AI	Google Gemini (text model for script, image model for art)
Hosting	Any server that can run Uvicorn, such as Render, Railway or a VPS

Constraints: API rate limits and cost per image, image consistency across panels, and content safety filtering.
